Subject: [PATCH 3/4] fix(ai): exempt OpenCode free-tier gate denial from
 direct credential rotation
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

isDirectCredentialRotationError rotated sibling keys on any 403, but the
OpenCode free-tier gate denial is model-scoped client policy: sibling keys
fail identically and the credential keeps serving paid SKUs. Extends the
same exclusion isAuthRetryableError already applies.

Live-gateway verified: old identity 403s with FreeTierError; branch
identity passes the gate (rate limiter answers instead).

